{% assign featured = settings.featured_product | default: all_products['mystic-clouds'] %}
<section class="editorial-hero section-pad"><span class="eyebrow">THE SOCKONLY STORY</span><h1>One thing.<br><em>Done with feeling.</em></h1><p>{{ section.settings.intro | escape }}</p></section>
<section class="feature-grid section-pad"><div class="story-photo">{% render 'product-image', image: featured.featured_image, eager: true %}</div><div class="prose"><h2>Head in the clouds.<br>Feet on the ground.</h2><p>{{ section.settings.story | escape }}</p><h3>More than a pretty pattern.</h3><p>The cloud pattern is jacquard-knit into the sock, rather than printed on top. Solid heels and toes keep the busy pattern where it belongs. A hand-linked toe seam keeps the finish smooth.</p><p>One style for now. More good ideas to come. That’s SockOnly.</p><a class="button navy" href="{{ featured.url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Meet Mystic Clouds {% render 'arrow' %}</a></div></section>
{% if page.content != blank %}<article class="policy prose section-pad">{{ page.content }}</article>{% endif %}
{% schema %}{"name":"Our story","settings":[{"type":"textarea","id":"intro","label":"Introduction","default":"We’re here for socks worth showing off. Starting with one pair, made with a whole lot of intention."},{"type":"textarea","id":"story","label":"Story","default":"Everyday essentials can have a point of view. Mystic Clouds brings together rolling shapes and four unexpected colors: navy, smoke blue, coral, and lilac. Thoughtful construction gives the pattern definition and combed cotton yarn gives it a soft hand."}]}{% endschema %}
